<title>LATVIA: STRENCHI FORESTRY IN 219,537 H1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>STRENCHI FORESTRY IN 219,537 H1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strenchi forestry, listed on the bourse's free list, reported 219,537 lats in half-year after-tax profit on turnover of 1.22 million lats, the stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the company's gross profit and loss was 372,682 lats.</p>
<p>It added that its balance on its balance sheet came to 1,426,975 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
